        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thornton Wilder, Richard Llewellyn\n- Works: The Long Christmas Dinner\n- Roles: Playwrights, novelists\n\nFacts:\n- Thornton Wilder was born on April 17, 1897, and was an American playwright and novelist.\n- Richard Llewellyn was born on December 8, 1906, as Richard Dafydd Vivian Llewellyn Lloyd and was a British novelist who used the pen name Richard Llewellyn.\n- Thornton Wilder wrote The Long Christmas Dinner as a one-act play in 1931.\n- Thornton Wilder died on December 7, 1975.\n- Richard Llewellyn died on November 30, 1983.",
